7}^{∘}-{180}^{∘} \\\\  & ={17}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 2**: The given ratio is $\\operatorname{sin}⁡{197}^{∘}$, and therefore we're interested in $\\operatorname{sin}⁡{\\theta }_{R}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡{17}^{∘}.$\n\n**Step 3:** The ratio $\\operatorname{sin}⁡{197}^{∘}$ must be *negative* because the sine ratio is *always* negative in the $3$rd quadrant. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{197}^{∘}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{17}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6d8fcf9e-df13-5b5c-a903-7cb43af2426c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6d8fcf9e-df13-5b5c-a903-7cb43af2426c" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d8fcf9e-df13-5b5c-a903-7cb43af2426c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c8bf9e37-3223-5311-ae58-de6d9f5ee716" :answer-field/choices ["answer-33c1b2bb-e8d5-5650-84a0-fe62bfe7ed4d" "answer-c8bf9e37-3223-5311-ae58-de6d9f5ee716" "answer-19431c0a-bdd3-5225-b483-6b0891c69d48" "answer-935f5752-b045-5b47-affc-7b3fa1825b85" "answer-7aab4335-e6f8-50ff-8426-deb0887acff3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-33c1b2bb-e8d5-5650-84a0-fe62bfe7ed4d" :answer/id #uuid "33c1b2bb-e8d5-5650-84a0-fe62bfe7ed4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{163}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c8bf9e37-3223-5311-ae58-de6d9f5ee716" :answer/id #uuid "c8bf9e37-3223-5311-ae58-de6d9f5ee716" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{17}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-19431c0a-bdd3-5225-b483-6b0891c69d48" :answer/id #uuid "19431c0a-bdd3-5225-b483-6b0891c69d48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡{163}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-935f5752-b045-5b47-affc-7b3fa1825b85" :answer/id #uuid "935f5752-b045-5b47-affc-7b3fa1825b85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡{17