7592186150809 :answer-field/choices 17592186150810] [:db/retract 17592186150809 :answer-field/choices 17592186150811] [:db/retract 17592186150809 :answer-field/choices 17592186150812] [:db/retract 17592186150809 :answer-field/choices 17592186150813] [:db/retract 17592186150809 :answer-field/choices 17592186150814] [:db/retract 17592186150827 :answer-field/choices 17592186150832] [:db/retract 17592186150827 :answer-field/choices 17592186150828] [:db/retract 17592186150827 :answer-field/choices 17592186150829] [:db/retract 17592186150827 :answer-field/choices 17592186150830] [:db/retract 17592186150827 :answer-field/choices 17592186150831] {:db/id 17592186152153 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-5f9a41d3-0af2-58dd-af4a-729df4a947b7" "question-2f8d79c3-b613-54e6-b2e9-de270331920a" "question-9fe67796-b4b4-5e92-895d-48a77cf8ca60"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186152154 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-8e6c279a-ebea-5cc3-9684-5647027801a8" "question-577873fb-8648-59ce-9de9-8ad820b016f9"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186152232 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-00814162-4a3c-58fe-a969-f047df1ff44b"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-5f9a41d3-0af2-58dd-af4a-729df4a947b7" :question/id #uuid "5f9a41d3-0af2-58dd-af4a-729df4a947b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-75321" :question/problem "Let $R=[3,7]\\times [0,4]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=2{x}^{2}+7{y}^{2}-10.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=2{x}^{2}+7{y}^{2}-10$ increases as $x$ increases on $[3,7],$ and\n\n- $f(x,y)=2{x}^{2}+7{y}^{2}-10$ increases as $y$ increases on $[0,4].$\n\n![](images/67/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/51/51808df96cf7dd295bfa24aa3641a601c821116e1a0014898ffe705036704a53.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=2{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(2{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-10)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $2{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-10.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a1c74bff-65e0-52ab-a110-4fb3d089fed9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a1c74bff-65e0-52ab-a110-4fb3d089fed9" :answer-field/id #uuid "a1c74bff-65e0-52ab-a110-4fb3d089fed9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0ac4729e-8c8c-50e9-af81-37849b7c020d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0ac4729e-8c8c-50e9-af81-37849b7c020d" "answer-c2aee6be-ca77-5900-9595-b950ed16105d" "answer-7acb1d76-417b-5aed-9993-7e382da4b0ff" "answer-6dc4f999-4db4-5bd7-b7a9-6fd0df71be86" "answer-878a3eb5-ad8a-5162-89a1-e11744ffc5a6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ac4729e-8c8c-50e9-af81-37849b7c020d" :answer/id #uuid "0ac4729e-8c8c-50e9-af81-37849b7c020d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c2aee6be-ca77-5900-9595-b950ed16105d" :answer/id #uuid "c2aee6be-ca77-5900-9595-b950ed16105d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j}^{2}-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7acb1d76-417b-5aed-9993-7e382da4b0ff" :answer/id #uuid "7acb1d76-417b-5aed-9993-7e382da4b0ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}_{i}^{2}+7{y}_{j}^{2}-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6dc4f999-4db4-5bd7-b7a9-6fd0df71be86" :answer/id #uuid "6dc4f999-4db4-5bd7-b7a9-6fd0df71be86" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-878a3eb5-ad8a-5162-89a1-e11744ffc5a6" :answer/id #uuid "878a3eb5-ad8a-5162-89a1-e11744ffc5a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+7{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2f8d79c3-b613-54e6-b2e9-de270331920a" :question/id #uuid "2f8d79c3-b613-54e6-b2e9-de270331920a" :question/math-academy-id "q-164124" :question/problem "Let $R=[0,1]\\times [1,2]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+2x.$ \nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+2x$ increases as $x$ increases on $[0,1]$, and\n\n- $f(x,y)={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+2x$ increases as $y$ increases on $[1,2].$\n\n![](images/67/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/51/51808df96cf7dd295bfa24aa3641a601c821116e1a0014898ffe705036704a53.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})={x}_{i-1}^{2}+{y}_{j-1}^{2}+2{x}_{i-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}^{2}+{y}_{j-1}^{2}+2{x}_{i-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is ${x}_{i-1}^{2}+{y}_{j-1}^{2}+2{x}_{i-1}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4f686c4b-9e7c-561e-8ea0-ed54cc445e3f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4f686c4b-9e7c-561e-8ea0-ed54cc445e3f" :answer-field/id #uuid "4f686c4b-9e7c-561e-8ea0-ed54cc445e3f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a4eb3739-cdd4-5966-bdce-45328695d2fc" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a4eb3739-cdd4-5966-bdce-45328695d2fc" "answer-e3b5c602-e4b2-58af-9e3d-48f821337d69" "answer-df46679a-b3ad-5fac-a8c0-89b76ac7c3cd" "answer-88ab93c5-2e6f-5e91-a07a-8001a388875a" "answer-e7651d5d-9a04-54e7-817f-50a0aa5721a4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a4eb3739-cdd4-5966-bdce-45328695d2fc" :answer/id #uuid "a4eb3739-cdd4-5966-bdce-45328695d2fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+{y}_{j-1}^{2}+2{x}_{i-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e3b5c602-e4b2-58af-9e3d-48f821337d69" :answer/id #uuid "e3b5c602-e4b2-58af-9e3d-48f821337d69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+{y}_{j}^{2}+2{x}_{i-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-df46679a-b3ad-5fac-a8c0-89b76ac7c3cd" :answer/id #uuid "df46679a-b3ad-5fac-a8c0-89b76ac7c3cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+{y}_{j}^{2}+{x}_{i-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-88ab93c5-2e6f-5e91-a07a-8001a388875a" :answer/id #uuid "88ab93c5-2e6f-5e91-a07a-8001a388875a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}^{2}+{y}_{j-1}^{2}+2{x}_{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e7651d5d-9a04-54e7-817f-50a0aa5721a4" :answer/id #uuid "e7651d5d-9a04-54e7-817f-50a0aa5721a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}^{2}+{y}_{j}^{2}+2{x}_{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9fe67796-b4b4-5e92-895d-48a77cf8ca60" :question/id #uuid "9fe67796-b4b4-5e92-895d-48a77cf8ca60" :question/math-academy-id "q-75304" :question/problem "Let $R=[-1,1]\\times [-1,1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=x+4y+5.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=x+4y+5$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=x+4y+5$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/67/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/51/51808df96cf7dd295bfa24aa3641a601c821116e1a0014898ffe705036704a53.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})={x}_{i-1}+4{y}_{j-1}+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+4{y}_{j-1}+5)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is ${x}_{i-1}+4{y}_{j-1}+5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ed7fed9c-f180-5feb-9c85-76f5919b0235"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ed7fed9c-f180-5feb-9c85-76f5919b0235" :answer-field/id #uuid "ed7fed9c-f180-5feb-9c85-76f5919b0235" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f2d2be4b-2c9e-563e-a447-219759f8e7ab" :answer-field/choices ["answer-896ee499-3dea-5f95-aeca-c273d0b97faf" "answer-b672f322-9411-5602-9130-870b752e20c6" "answer-f2d2be4b-2c9e-563e-a447-219759f8e7ab" "answer-cbeceaca-d3e1-5371-ad66-45ceae3d7944" "answer-57764a62-5dc0-5a82-b628-694ac391cee2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-896ee499-3dea-5f95-aeca-c273d0b97faf" :answer/id #uuid "896ee499-3dea-5f95-aeca-c273d0b97faf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}_{i-1}+{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b672f322-9411-5602-9130-870b752e20c6" :answer/id #uuid "b672f322-9411-5602-9130-870b752e20c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}_{i}+{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f2d2be4b-2c9e-563e-a447-219759f8e7ab" :answer/id #uuid "f2d2be4b-2c9e-563e-a447-219759f8e7ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}+4{y}_{j-1}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cbeceaca-d3e1-5371-ad66-45ceae3d7944" :answer/id #uuid "cbeceaca-d3e1-5371-ad66-45ceae3d7944" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j-1}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-57764a62-5dc0-5a82-b628-694ac391cee2" :answer/id #uuid "57764a62-5dc0-5a82-b628-694ac391cee2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186152718 :question/problem "Let $R=[-1,1]\\times [-1,1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=8-x-y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=8-x-y$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=8-x-y$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/4a/4a10c8332a5f346d393c37531c13db6aa69d4cecb241efd7c34d57f32d5a98b8.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=8-{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(8-{x}_{i}-{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $8-{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186150815 :answer-field/correct "answer-586e1e12-4b69-5b7f-82ab-a83c9ddbe233" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5ffd6892-9184-53c9-884c-ef1fd9595d21" "answer-77f8de92-b6f2-5c9c-9dfd-cff3de94806a" "answer-06a53e38-46ea-523d-a5e1-3ffcfcf1258e" "answer-586e1e12-4b69-5b7f-82ab-a83c9ddbe233" "answer-f8ac1e00-9c17-5578-83d7-9b593f307fb4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5ffd6892-9184-53c9-884c-ef1fd9595d21" :answer/id #uuid "5ffd6892-9184-53c9-884c-ef1fd9595d21" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}_{i-1}-{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-77f8de92-b6f2-5c9c-9dfd-cff3de94806a" :answer/id #uuid "77f8de92-b6f2-5c9c-9dfd-cff3de94806a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-06a53e38-46ea-523d-a5e1-3ffcfcf1258e" :answer/id #uuid "06a53e38-46ea-523d-a5e1-3ffcfcf1258e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8-{x}_{i-1}-{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-586e1e12-4b69-5b7f-82ab-a83c9ddbe233" :answer/id #uuid "586e1e12-4b69-5b7f-82ab-a83c9ddbe233" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8-{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f8ac1e00-9c17-5578-83d7-9b593f307fb4" :answer/id #uuid "f8ac1e00-9c17-5578-83d7-9b593f307fb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}+{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-8e6c279a-ebea-5cc3-9684-5647027801a8" :question/id #uuid "8e6c279a-ebea-5cc3-9684-5647027801a8" :question/math-academy-id "q-164126" :question/problem "Let $R=[0,2]\\times [1,3]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=160-{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=160-{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}$ decreases as $x$ increases on $[0,2]$, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=160-{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}$ decreases as $y$ increases on $[1,3].$\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/4a/4a10c8332a5f346d393c37531c13db6aa69d4cecb241efd7c34d57f32d5a98b8.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=160-{x}_{i}^{2}-2{y}_{j}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(160-{x}_{i}^{2}-2{y}_{j}^{2})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $160-{x}_{i}^{2}-2{y}_{j}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5424b5dc-8d67-5770-96ab-35a00ee79a30"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5424b5dc-8d67-5770-96ab-35a00ee79a30" :answer-field/id #uuid "5424b5dc-8d67-5770-96ab-35a00ee79a30" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-27a5dea6-84d8-526d-9c28-419651f149c2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-68c5de99-ca70-5eb2-9b6b-34ec81937577" "answer-ef6ef2ea-2453-5bbc-8630-9a71d29f5017" "answer-15287f6a-7570-5668-95d1-27e2083812d0" "answer-ed036525-be4c-59cb-8765-6f9ccf606242" "answer-27a5dea6-84d8-526d-9c28-419651f149c2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-68c5de99-ca70-5eb2-9b6b-34ec81937577" :answer/id #uuid "68c5de99-ca70-5eb2-9b6b-34ec81937577" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}_{i}^{2}-2{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ef6ef2ea-2453-5bbc-8630-9a71d29f5017" :answer/id #uuid "ef6ef2ea-2453-5bbc-8630-9a71d29f5017" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16-2{x}_{i}^{2}-2{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-15287f6a-7570-5668-95d1-27e2083812d0" :answer/id #uuid "15287f6a-7570-5668-95d1-27e2083812d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "160-{x}_{i-1}^{2}-2{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ed036525-be4c-59cb-8765-6f9ccf606242" :answer/id #uuid "ed036525-be4c-59cb-8765-6f9ccf606242" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "160-{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-27a5dea6-84d8-526d-9c28-419651f149c2" :answer/id #uuid "27a5dea6-84d8-526d-9c28-419651f149c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "160-{x}_{i}^{2}-2{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186152717 :question/problem "Let $R=[1,5]\\times [2,7]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=100-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=100-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}$ decreases as $x$ increases on $[1,5]$, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=100-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}$ decreases as $y$ increases on $[2,7].$\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/4a/4a10c8332a5f346d393c37531c13db6aa69d4cecb241efd7c34d57f32d5a98b8.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=100-{x}_{i}^{2}-{y}_{j}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(100-{x}_{i}^{2}-{y}_{j}^{2})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $100-{x}_{i}^{2}-{y}_{j}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186150809 :answer-field/correct "answer-39715562-cfd6-5124-85de-10923f2f02d1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-401993be-2c94-5901-a6c3-4b06e427b4d5" "answer-8405b19b-4be9-51fb-97b0-ea7d7a0ceb6e" "answer-39715562-cfd6-5124-85de-10923f2f02d1" "answer-c71b3e38-9d3a-521c-8bb5-19963d524100" "answer-e88553cc-bcac-59c5-81de-b009be765660"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-401993be-2c94-5901-a6c3-4b06e427b4d5" :answer/id #uuid "401993be-2c94-5901-a6c3-4b06e427b4d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "100-{x}_{i+1}^{2}-{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8405b19b-4be9-51fb-97b0-ea7d7a0ceb6e" :answer/id #uuid "8405b19b-4be9-51fb-97b0-ea7d7a0ceb6e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "100-{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-